alization, and manufacture of products containing Avutometinib; and Pfizer Inc. to research, develop, manufacture, and commercialize products containing Pfizer's inhibitors of FAK for therapeutic, diagnostic, and prophylactic uses in humans. In addition, it has a clinical collaboration agreement with Amgen, Inc. to evaluate the combination of Avutometinib with Amgen's KRAS-G12C inhibitor LUMAKRAS, which in Phase 1/2 trial entitled RAMP 203; VS-7375, and VS-7375-101 is a discovery and development collaboration with GenFleet Therapeutics to advance new programs targeting RAS pathway-driven cancers; and AVMAPKI, FAKZYNJA, CO-PACK, is an avutometinib capsules, and defactinib tablets. The company was incorporated in 2010 and is headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts.","employees":102,"website":"https://www.verastem.com","country":"United States","city":"Needham","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Daniel W. Paterson","title":"President, CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Daniel  Calkins","title":"Chief Financial Officer"},{"name":"Dr. Michael Glen Kauffman M.D., Ph.D.","title":"President of Development & Director"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":18.89,"tpe":30.04,"ps":4.318,"pfcf":28.14,"peg":1.36,"pb":4.619,"ev_ebitda":16.75,"rev_growth":0.1,"eps_growth":0.167,"eps_growth_fwd":0.0928,"eps_growth_next":0.1205,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.01454,"roa":0.02187,"de":41.94,"gross_margin":0.4983,"op_margin":0.04015,"profit_margin":0,"current_ratio":3.084},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":-1,"sector":18.89,"verdict":"Loss-making"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":-1,"sector":30.04,"verdict":"Loss-making"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":13.94,"sector":4.318,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":-1,"sector":28.14,"verdict":"Negative FCF"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":null,"sector":1.36,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":18.19,"sector":4.619,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":168.7,"sector":41.94,"verdict":"High 